WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.359 --> 00:00:03.593
WELCOME TO "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:03.594 --> 00:00:03.960
TONIGHT."

00:00:03.961 --> 00:00:06.129
SINCE 9/11 THE U.S. HAS SPENT

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.330
TRILLIONS OF DOLLARS AND

00:00:07.331 --> 00:00:08.165
THOUSANDS OF AMERICAN LIVES

00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:09.566
TRYING TO REMAKE THE MIDDLE

00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.368
EAST IN OUR IMAGE.

00:00:11.369 --> 00:00:13.336
IT IS SAD TO SAY IT OUT LOUD

00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:14.804
BUT WE HAVE TO.

00:00:14.805 --> 00:00:15.505
IT HASN'T WORKED.

00:00:15.506 --> 00:00:16.806
MANY OF US THOUGHT IT WOULD

00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:17.874
BUT IT HASN'T.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.009
BY EVERY MEASURE OUR FOREIGN

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.444
WARS ENDED IN DISMAL FAILURE

00:00:21.445 --> 00:00:22.045
FOR THE UNITED STATES.

00:00:22.046 --> 00:00:22.579
HOWEVER NOBLE THEIR

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.346
INTENTIONS.

00:00:23.347 --> 00:00:25.482
SOME DID HAVE NOBLE

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:25.882
INTENTIONS.

00:00:25.883 --> 00:00:27.651
DONALD TRUMP WAS ONE OF THE

00:00:27.652 --> 00:00:28.919
RARE POLITICIANS HONEST ENOUGH

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.619
TO ADMIT THIS.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:31.021
HE SAID IT OUT LOUD THREE

00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:32.422
YEARS A AND PROMISED NOT TO

00:00:32.423 --> 00:00:34.224
REPEAT THE SAME MISTAKES IF

00:00:34.225 --> 00:00:35.125
ELECTED PRESIDENT.

00:00:35.126 --> 00:00:35.959
PARTLY BECAUSE HE SAID THAT,

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.460
HE WAS ELECTED PRESIDENT.

00:00:37.461 --> 00:00:38.828
NOW SOMETHING FASCINATING IS

00:00:38.829 --> 00:00:39.396
HAPPENING.

00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:41.431
THE VERY PEOPLE, IN SOME CASES

00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:43.066
LITERALLY THE SAME PEOPLE WHO

00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:45.235
LURED US IN TO THE IRAQ

00:00:45.236 --> 00:00:46.736
QUAGMIRE 16 YEARS AGO ARE

00:00:46.737 --> 00:00:47.671
DEMANDING A NEW WAR.

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:49.806
THIS ONE WITH IRAN.

00:00:49.807 --> 00:00:51.641
THE PRESIDENT TO HIS GREAT

00:00:51.642 --> 00:00:53.143
CREDIT APPEARS TO BE SKEPTICAL

00:00:53.144 --> 00:00:53.944
OF THIS.

00:00:53.945 --> 00:00:55.378
VERY SKEPTICAL.

00:00:55.379 --> 00:00:57.314
IRAN RECENTLY DOWNED AN

00:00:57.315 --> 00:00:58.014
UNMANNED AMERICAN DRONE.

00:00:58.015 --> 00:00:59.482
THE PRESIDENT SPEAKING TODAY

00:00:59.483 --> 00:01:00.750
SEEMED TO SUGGEST THIS

00:01:00.751 --> 00:01:01.685
SHOULDN'T NECESSARILY TRIGGER

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:02.919
A CONFLICT WITH IRAN.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.553
WATCH.

00:01:03.554 --> 00:01:04.387
&gt;&gt; President Trump: IRAN

00:01:04.388 --> 00:01:07.257
MADE A BIG MISTAKE.

00:01:07.258 --> 00:01:08.959
THIS DRONE WAS IN

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:09.960
INTERNATIONAL WATERS CLEARLY.

00:01:09.961 --> 00:01:12.896
WE HAVE IT DOCUMENTED.

00:01:12.897 --> 00:01:13.930
I WOULD IMAGINE IT WAS A

00:01:13.931 --> 00:01:15.232
GENERAL OR SOMEBODY WHO MADE A

00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:17.033
MISTAKE SHOOTING THAT DRONE

00:01:17.034 --> 00:01:18.034
DOWN.

00:01:18.035 --> 00:01:20.270
FORTUNATELY THAT DRONE WAS

00:01:20.271 --> 00:01:20.737
UNARMED.

00:01:20.738 --> 00:01:22.806
THERE WAS NO MAN IN IT, THERE

00:01:22.807 --> 00:01:26.276
WAS NO -- IT WAS JUST, IT WAS

00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:27.010
OVER INTERNATIONAL WATERS.

00:01:27.011 --> 00:01:27.711
CLEARLY OVER INTERNATIONAL

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:28.044
WATERS.

00:01:28.045 --> 00:01:29.813
BE YOU WE DIDN'T HAVE A MAN OR

00:01:29.814 --> 00:01:30.547
WOMAN IN THE DRONE.

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:31.548
NOBODY WAS IN THE DRONE.

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:33.416
I WOULD HAVE MADE A BIG

00:01:33.417 --> 00:01:33.817
DIFFERENCE.

00:01:33.818 --> 00:01:34.751
LET ME TELL YOU.

00:01:34.752 --> 00:01:35.785
I WOULD HAVE MADE A BIG

00:01:35.786 --> 00:01:36.186
DIFFERENCE.

00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:37.621
I FIND IT HARD TO BELIEVE IT

00:01:37.622 --> 00:01:38.588
WAS INTENTIONAL IF YOU WANT TO

00:01:38.589 --> 00:01:39.389
KNOW THE TRUTH.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:41.124
IT COULD HAVE BEEN SOMEBODY

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:43.393
WHO WAS LOOSE AND STUPID THAT

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:44.127
DID IT.

00:01:44.128 --> 00:01:46.229
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO THAT IS NOT

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:50.000
NEARLY BELLICOSE ENOUGH FOR

00:01:50.001 --> 00:01:51.735
THE CURRENT FOREIGN POLICY

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:52.102
ESTABLISH.

00:01:52.103 --> 00:01:57.073
IN WASHINGTON MANY OF WHOM

00:01:57.074 --> 00:01:58.341
CRAVE WAR WITH IRAN.

00:01:58.342 --> 00:01:59.609
SENATOR GRAHAM SAYS AMERICANS

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.344
SHOULD BE READY FIGHT AND DIE

00:02:01.345 --> 00:02:02.412
FOR SHIPPING LANES ON THE

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:03.346
OTHER SIDE OF THE WORLD.

00:02:03.347 --> 00:02:03.780
WATCH.

00:02:03.781 --> 00:02:04.981
&gt;&gt; HERE IS WHAT TO WATCH FOR.

00:02:04.982 --> 00:02:07.017
IF THE IRANIANS FOLLOW THROUGH

00:02:07.018 --> 00:02:08.418
ON THEIR THREAT TO START

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:09.919
ENRICHING AGAIN AT HIGHER

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.690
LEVELS TO BASICALLY TAKE THEIR

00:02:13.691 --> 00:02:14.357
ENRICH.

00:02:14.358 --> 00:02:15.525
PROGRAM A NUCLEAR LEVEL IN

00:02:15.526 --> 00:02:17.661
TERMS OF THE WEAPON-GRADE

00:02:17.662 --> 00:02:18.728
PRODUCTION, ISRAEL IS IN A

00:02:18.729 --> 00:02:19.396
WORLD OF HURT.

00:02:19.397 --> 00:02:20.463
SO THE BEST THING THE

00:02:20.464 --> 00:02:22.499
PRESIDENT CAN DO IS STOP THAT.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.634
HOW DO YOU STOP THAT?

00:02:24.635 --> 00:02:25.702
TO MAKE IRAN UNDERSTAND YOU

00:02:25.703 --> 00:02:27.437
ARE NOT GOING TO LET IT

00:02:27.438 --> 00:02:29.606
HAPPEN, PUT THE OIL REFINERIES

00:02:29.607 --> 00:02:32.876
ON A TARGET LIST, LOOK TO SINK

00:02:32.877 --> 00:02:34.577
THE IRANIAN NAVY IF THEY

00:02:34.578 --> 00:02:35.578
ATTACK SHIPPING AGAIN.

00:02:35.579 --> 00:02:36.313
&gt;&gt; Tucker: UH-HUH.

00:02:36.314 --> 00:02:37.714
SO IN WASHINGTON THERE ARE NO

00:02:37.715 --> 00:02:38.982
REAL CONSEQUENCES FOR BEING

00:02:38.983 --> 00:02:39.282
WRONG.

00:02:39.283 --> 00:02:41.785
AS A RESULT, POLICY-MAKERS

00:02:41.786 --> 00:02:42.118
ARE.

00:02:42.119 --> 00:02:43.620
THEY MAKE THE SAME MISTAKES

00:02:43.621 --> 00:02:44.321
AGAIN AND AGAIN.

00:02:44.322 --> 00:02:45.889
IT'S CERTAINLY NOT JUST

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.824
LINDSEY GRAHAM.

00:02:47.825 --> 00:02:51.328
AT THE "NEW YORK TIMES" LEFT

00:02:51.329 --> 00:02:52.629
WING WAR MONGER BRET STEPHENS

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:55.765
CALLING TO SINK THE IRANIAN

00:02:55.766 --> 00:02:56.066
NAVY.

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:57.400
JOHN BOLTON CHEERS HIM ON IN

00:02:57.401 --> 00:02:58.435
THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:02:58.436 --> 00:02:59.369
BILL CRYSTAL NODS WITH

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.070
APPROVAL OUTSIDE THE WHITE

00:03:00.071 --> 00:03:00.370
HOUSE.

00:03:00.371 --> 00:03:01.938
NONE OF THE PEOPLE WOULD ADMIT

00:03:01.939 --> 00:03:02.872
THE ACTUAL INTENTION.

00:03:02.873 --> 00:03:04.708
THEY DON'T REALLY WANT A WAR

00:03:04.709 --> 00:03:05.308
WITH IRAN.

00:03:05.309 --> 00:03:06.142
THAT IS A CROCK.

00:03:06.143 --> 00:03:07.610
THEY WANT A WAR BADLY.

00:03:07.611 --> 00:03:08.912
BADLY ENOUGH TO LIE ABOUT IT.

00:03:08.913 --> 00:03:10.747
